      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u274c Retrospective: Done hours or days after the event.\n\n\u274c Subjective: Often tries to define absolute truth, leading to political bias debates.\n\n\u274c Offline & Disjointed: Fact-checkers must execute disconnected queries across isolated transcript archives.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
